  m_Name: Courier's Camp Notes
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Courier's Camp Notes
  content: 'Courier''s Camp Notes


    Third night on the northern route.


    The
    roads haven''t changed much but they feel quieter.

    Normally I''d hear birds
    before sunrise, or merchants complaining before breakfast.


    Tonight there
    was only the wind.

    A Warden I passed yesterday mentioned something called
    the Waning. He said not to wander after dusk if I saw flowers blooming where
    they shouldn''t.


    I laughed.

    I don''t think he was joking.'
